{"id": "114-2-D-061", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 61, "stem": "肝臟超音波橫向掃描時，在外側節段（lateral segment, L）與尾葉（caudate lobe, C）之間有\n一高回音裂隙（fissure, F），如下圖箭號處。此高回音裂隙與下列何者最有關係？", "options": {"A": "靜脈韌帶（ligamentum venosum）", "B": "動脈韌帶（ligamentum arteriosum）", "C": "圓韌帶（ligamentum teres）", "D": "鎌狀韌帶（falciform ligament）"}, "answer": "A", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": true, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "114-2-D-062", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 62, "stem": "肝臟超音波橫向掃描時，發現一個高回音性病灶，介於右肝靜脈（right hepatic vein, RHV）與\n中肝靜脈（middle hepatic vein, MHV）之間（如下圖）。根據Couinaud classification的分\n類，此病灶應在肝臟的那一個節段（segment）？", "options": {"A": "8（VIII）", "B": "7（VII）", "C": "4（IV）", "D": "3（III）"}, "answer": "A", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": true, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "114-2-D-063", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 63, "stem": "右上腹部超音波掃描時，發現一囊狀構造橫徑超過4公分，壁厚超過3公釐，內有高回音結構且具有\n後側音影（acoustic shadowing），以及陽性超音波墨菲氏徵象（positive sonographic\nMurphy's sign），下圖最有可能的診斷為何？", "options": {"A": "急性結石性膽囊炎（acute calculous cholecystitis）", "B": "急性無結石性膽囊炎（acute acalculous cholecystitis）", "C": "急性氣腫性膽囊炎（acute emphysematous cholecystitis）", "D": "膽結石性腸阻塞（gallstone ileus）"}, "answer": "A", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": true, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "114-2-D-064", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 64, "stem": "關於膀胱超音波的敘述，下列何者正確？", "options": {"A": "正常的膀胱為均勻的中度回音", "B": "膀胱體積測量為橫徑、前後徑、上下徑的乘積，再乘以0.52", "C": "慢性膀胱炎會呈現較薄的膀胱壁", "D": "膀胱結石會造成後方回音增強"}, "answer": "B", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "114-2-D-065", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 65, "stem": "超音波掃描單純性肝臟囊腫（simple hepatic cyst），一般不會出現下列何種情形？", "options": {"A": "內部無回音", "B": "界限清晰，呈圓形或橢圓形", "C": "囊腫兩側呈現鏡像影像", "D": "囊腫後方呈現回音增強"}, "answer": "C", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "114-2-D-066", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 66, "stem": "下圖為肋骨弓下緣之超音波掃描影像，其編號A、B、C的解剖位置，依序應為下列何者?", "options": {"A": "腹主動脈、門靜脈、左肝靜脈", "B": "腹主動脈、肝動脈、右肝靜脈", "C": "下腔靜脈、門靜脈、右肝靜脈", "D": "下腔靜脈、門靜脈、左肝靜脈"}, "answer": "C", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": true, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "114-2-D-067", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 67, "stem": "關於消化系統超音波掃描的敘述，下列何者錯誤？", "options": {"A": "正常的膽囊壁厚度應小於6 mm", "B": "正常的總膽管直徑通常小於7 mm", "C": "若膽囊已切除的病人，總膽管直徑達 9 mm，仍可算正常", "D": "正常的胰管直徑大小應小於3 mm"}, "answer": "A", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "114-2-D-068", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 68, "stem": "附圖中箭號所指高回音的部位最可能為何？", "options": {"A": "腎髓質（medulla）", "B": "腎竇部（renal sinus）", "C": "腎盂（pelvis）", "D": "腎皮質（cortex）"}, "answer": "B", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": true, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "114-2-D-069", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 69, "stem": "附圖為上腹部超音波影像，箭號所指的低回音構造為下列何者？", "options": {"A": "腹腔動脈幹（celiac trunk）", "B": "上腸繫膜動脈（superior mesenteric artery）", "C": "右肝靜脈（right hepatic vein）", "D": "右腎動脈（right renal artery）"}, "answer": "B", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": true, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "114-2-D-070", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 70, "stem": "附圖為右上腹部超音波斜縱向掃描，箭號所指的構造最可能為下列何者？", "options": {"A": "膽囊（gallbladder）", "B": "總膽管（common bile duct）", "C": "下腔靜脈（inferior vena cava）", "D": "門靜脈（portal vein）"}, "answer": "B", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": true, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "114-2-D-071", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "D", "number": 71, "stem": "脾臟超音波掃描如附圖影像，箭號所指最可能為何？", "options": {"A": "pancreatic tail", "B": "accessory spleen", "C": "splenic vein", "D": "renal cyst"}, "answer": "B", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": true, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
